# ============================================================
#  WARNING: this repo lives in C:\Users\tiend  (the HOME folder).
#  It default-DENIES the whole home directory so a stray
#  `git add .` can never commit secrets (.ssh keys, cookies,
#  tokens) or giant folders like Downloads\NRO (~1.9 GB).
#
#  `/*` is anchored, so it excludes each TOP-LEVEL entry itself.
#  Because the directory itself is excluded, nested .gitignore
#  files (e.g. .cursor/.gitignore) cannot re-include anything
#  inside them.
#
#  To track something new, whitelist it below, e.g.
#      !/some-folder/
#      !/some-folder/**
# ============================================================

# 1. deny every top-level file and folder
/*
# 2. ...then allow only what belongs to this repo
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/tuantomo97/
!/tuantomo97/**

# OS / editor noise (applies everywhere)
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
